TEXT -480 -384 Left 3 ;#200 Two PIN diode T/R switch and quarter-wave equivalent
TEXT -480 -320 Left 2 ;Source: Alan Wolke (W2AEW), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A1BAq0KxIdc
TEXT -480 -272 Left 2 ;TXON=1 passes TX to antenna and shunts RX; TXON=0 routes antenna to RX. The PIN diode model and the unlabelled antenna capacitor are documented substitutes.
